IL released. ECHILD when"] [127 1 "// pid is no child of this process (no /proc entry, another parent)."] [135 60 "// from field 3, state"] [140 33 "// field 52, exit_code"] [146 59 "// SYS_pidfd_open, the same on amd64 and arm64"] [179 2 "// waitid over wait4 (no siginfo_t without pointers): P_ALL, P_PID, P_PGID; WEXITED, WSTOPPED, WCONTINUED and"] [180 2 "// WNOHANG as wait4's options; si_uid the caller's, si_signo SIGCHLD. WNOWAIT (asyncio's _ThreadedChildWatcher:"] [181 2 "// no asyncio subprocess ended without it) for P_PID and WEXITED alone: waitidNoWait"] [200 11 "// P_ALL"] [201 11 "// P_PID"] [203 11 "// P_PGID"] [212 29 "// WNOWAIT"] [226 71 "// the GIL released while it blocks (PY6f's allowThreads; queue 200, PY6-core)"] [343 2 "// ---- descriptors"] [389 47 "// SEEK_CUR, from the offset on"] [481 2 "// copy_file_range and splice: the system calls when no offset is given; an offset as pread from it or pwrite"] [482 2 "// at it (the calls need a pointer to it), the descriptor's own offset left alone as the calls leave it"] [539 22 "// SYS_copy_file_range: amd64's, arm64's 285 (not in Go's syscall tables)"] [546 2 "// ---- the scheduler"] [566 44 "// musl's sched_getscheduler"] [569 2 "// ---- eventfd, pidfd_open"] [653 71 "// SYS_pidfd_open, the same on amd64 and arm64"] [661 3 "// musl's getlogin: $LOGNAME"] [668 2 "// ---- the environment"] [702 24 "// set by the program: in os.reload_environ() again (py-os-1124)"] [716 3 "// os._clearenv (3.15, Modules/posixmodule.c; queue 252): clearenv(3), os.environ.clear's fast path (pyi has"] [717 3 "// no audit hooks for posix, as for putenv)"]] :go/pos {:name [3 9] :package [3 1]} :go/semis [[23 22] [164 48] [189 24] [307 36] [350 24] [378 122] [393 67] [429 34] [499 25] [563 57] [630 13] [630 20] [662 38] [671 23] [673 27] [676 32]]} (go/file "builtins_posix_ids.go" :build ["//go:build linux"] :imports [


